# A tower for impostors (see docs/content/kinds/meshes.md#impostors): a block 2 m square and 6 m high on the origin,
# and a smaller roof block on it, each a closed box fronting out. Slot 0 is the block and 1 the roof. Its .meta file
# bakes an impostor, which the billboards scene's far towers draw as.
